  "title": {
   "en": "Go to Go"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "伍と碁"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Kousei Akiyama, a \"prodigy\" with unmatched talent in everything from baseball to soccer to studying since childhood, was known for his exceptional abilities. As a 6th grader, Kousei aspired to make his name known worldwide by pursuing the path of Go. However, the Go class he attended was filled with five talented boys and girls who could crush his abilities. After experiencing failure and leading a mundane life, Kousei reunites with Go as a high schooler, where he reignites his talent and vows revenge on the five geniuses. He is determined to reclaim that invincible feeling from his childhood!",
   "ja": "野球もサッカーも勉強も、小さい頃からどんなことにおいても他を寄せ付けない才能があった「神童」の秋山恒星。小6の恒星は自分の名を世界に轟かせるため囲碁の道を志す。しかし恒星が通った囲碁教室にいたのはその才能をも握り潰す5人の天才少年少女だったーー。挫折を経験し平凡な人生のまま高校生になった恒星は再び囲碁と出会い、そして才能を開花させ5人へのリベンジを誓う。あの頃の、あの無敵感を取り戻すためにーー！"
  },
